&lt;b&gt;Attaques sp&#233;ciales&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Absorption-De-Sang-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Absorption de sang (Ext)&quot;&gt;absorption de sang&lt;/a&gt; (1d2 Constitution)
